# apps/web environment — foundation build (Phase 01)
#
# The web app currently reads NO environment variables. Live providers,
# authentication and storage are not implemented yet, so there is nothing
# to configure here.
#
# Rules for later phases:
# - Never place provider API keys or service-role keys in NEXT_PUBLIC_*
#   variables: public-prefixed values are shipped to the browser.
# - The browser must talk to our own voice service, not directly to a
#   speech provider, so provider keys stay server-side.
# - The voice-service base URL will be added here after the configuration
#   boundary is frozen in Phase 03 (planned name: VOICE_SERVICE_ORIGIN).
